Package: openforensic-imager
Version: @VERSION@-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: OpenForensic Imager Maintainers <maintainer@invalid>
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Homepage: https://github.com/x0r909/openforensic-imager
Description: Linux-native digital forensics acquisition workbench
 OpenForensic Imager creates and verifies RAW and EWF1 images, analyzes MBR and
 GPT partition tables, browses supported filesystems through The Sleuth Kit, and
 records case metadata and audit events.
 .
 This is a Phase 7 development package. The project license is undecided and the
 parser worker isolation release blocker remains open.
